[{:db/id 17592186147457 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-fbf9409a-1720-5462-9ab8-4c6044063a13" "question-38141e03-61b4-558c-abfb-f277b3a033ff" "question-e60eea56-b427-5554-9260-c384e7c36c6c" "question-72ba30e8-1cbe-509c-ae19-e92cb08fa3dd" "question-a302f60b-7ac6-5bd3-91c2-e49fdf9e6d2e"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186147140 :question/problem "What is missing from the statement below?\n\n$$\n10 \\times \\dfrac{2}{5} = \\bbox[2pt, border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{A}} \\div \\bbox[2pt, border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{A}} \\times 2\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Interpreting the fraction as division, we can write our expression as:\n\n$$\n10 \\times 2\\div 5\n$$\n\nWe can write an equivalent expression by swapping the $\\times 2$ and the $\\div 5\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\bbox[2pt, border:1pt solid black]{10} \\div \\bbox[2pt, border:1pt solid black]{5} \\times 2\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing part is $10 \\div 5.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186147458 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-1d0aa5ce-bef4-5f61-8cd3-3ad3d30730f6" "question-18b53bd3-8461-5864-bd5c-962245912e60" "question-97ce7fa9-f185-57d6-86a7-d97c69aa9c15" "question-5e8c3fc2-f048-5f3f-aa80-96ceea553188"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186147141 :question/problem "What fraction is missing from the statement below?\n\n![](images/fb/fb748fd8124576b52ee9af881b5559ac005e2a50615ba9b6604269fbce002d38.svg)" :question/worked-solution "We can write an equivalent expression by swapping the $\\div 5$ and the $\\times 20\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n7 \\times 20 \\div 5\n$$\n\nWe can now interpret the division as a fraction:\n\n$$\n7\\times \\dfrac{20}{5}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing fraction is $\\dfrac{20}{5}.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186147459 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-6e2e7594-12cd-5a88-800d-ba9027727e18" "question-e0666618-19d3-5e34-acb6-ed1682b8b1da" "question-b5a2e4e1-a6b8-518f-a7b8-fb72717bc055" "question-ead06897-7927-58